  "title": "17 December 1961: The Beatles' first photo session",
  "date": "1961-12-17",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>In December 1961 The Beatles’ manager <a href=\"/people/brian-epstein/\">Brian Epstein</a> contacted a local wedding photographer, Albert Marrion, to see if he could take some pictures of the group. <span id=\"more-7750\"></span></p><p>The session, which took place on this day, was The Beatles’ first professional photography session. They had been photographed several times before, most notably by <a href=\"/people/astrid-kirchherr/\">Astrid Kirchherr</a> and Jurgen Vollmer in Hamburg, but never before as part of a contractually-arranged and paid-for session.</p><p>On 17 December 1961 The Beatles and Epstein arrived at Marrion’s studio at 268 Wallasey Village, Wallasey, Merseyside.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/12/17/beatles-first-photo-session/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-7750 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1961-photos/611217_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"155\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01-200x155.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at their first photo session, 17 December 1961\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01-200x155.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01-580x450.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8823\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1961-photos/611217_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"760,590\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at their first photo session, 17 December 1961\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_01.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1961-photos/611217_02/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02-200x156.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at their first photo session, 17 December 1961\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02-200x156.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02-580x453.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8824\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1961-photos/611217_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"760,593\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"2\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at their first photo session, 17 December 1961\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_02.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1961-photos/611217_03/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_03-200x156.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at their first photo session, 17 December 1961\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_03-200x156.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_03-580x451.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/611217_03.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8825\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/galle